1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.762
Kenako, pitirizani kuyang'ana kumbuyo kwa diso.

2
00:00:04.762 --> 00:00:10.928
Gwirani ophthalmoscope m'dzanja lanu lamanja kuti muwone diso lakumanja ndi mosemphanitsa.

3
00:00:10.928 --> 00:00:15.450
Yambani ndi mapazi anu pafupi ndi wodwalayo ndikutsamira mmbuyo.

4
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:19.972
Funsani wodwalayo kuti akonze mtunda womwe akufuna

5
00:00:19.972 --> 00:00:24.494
yopingasa ndikupewa kuyang'ana kuwala kwa ophthalmoscope.

6
00:00:24.494 --> 00:00:32.305
Pang'ono ndi pang'ono yambani kusuntha kuchokera ku 10 mpaka 15 madigiri osakhalitsa pa meridian yopingasa ndi zero mphamvu lens.

7
00:00:32.305 --> 00:00:37.238
Sungani reflex yofiira ndikuyandikira pafupi ndi wodwalayo.

8
00:00:37.238 --> 00:00:41.760
Optic disc iyenera kuwonekera mukakana

9
00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:42.418
centimita kutali.

10
00:00:42.418 --> 00:00:46.040
Ndemanga za momwe malire a diski amasiyanirana, a

11
00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:51.002
mtundu wa mkombero wa neuro-retinal ndi chiŵerengero cha kapu to disc.

12
00:00:51.002 --> 00:00:53.980
Ngati simungathe kuwona disk,

13
00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:57.460
ndiye kusuntha kumene nthambi za chotengera cha retina.

14
00:00:57.460 --> 00:01:00.905
Izi zidzakutsogolerani ku disc.

15
00:01:00.905 --> 00:01:04.350
Pakufufuza uku ndi mitsempha ya optic

16
00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:04.659
kutupa.

17
00:01:04.659 --> 00:01:08.670
Mphepete mwa nyanjayo ndi yosadziwika bwino ndipo chikho chapakati palibe chifukwa chokhalapo

18
00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:10.941
kudzazidwa ndi minyewa yotupa yozungulira.

19
00:01:10.941 --> 00:01:13.590
Ma capillaries abwino pamwamba pa

20
00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:17.192
minyewa yomwe inabisika, monganso ena mwa mitsempha yayikulu.

21
00:01:17.192 --> 00:01:18.830
Mitsempha ndi kutupa ndi

22
00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:21.620
pali kukha magazi pang'ono komwe kulipo 9 koloko.

23
00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:23.790
Zizindikiro zonsezi zimagwirizana ndi papillodema

24
00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:27.783
chifukwa cha kuthamanga kwa intracranial.

25
00:01:27.783 --> 00:01:34.970
Mitsempha yama optic iyi imakhala ndi malire odziwika kwambiri,

26
00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:40.948
