27
00:01:40.948 --> 00:01:46.072
Ichi ndi mawonekedwe a optocatrophe.

28
00:01:46.072 --> 00:01:47.780
Mu izi

29
00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:51.689
kuunika kapu yapakati imakulitsidwa ndi kupatulira kwa m'mphepete mwa neuroretinal.

30
00:01:51.689 --> 00:01:52.340
Mitsempha

31
00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:57.540
Chifukwa chake ali ndi chiŵerengero chokulitsidwa cha kapu ku disc cha 0.8, chosonyeza kukhalapo kwa

